topic: ~Greetings()
language: enu

# 1. Introduction


u:(["Good morning, I am Doctor Maria"])
    ^pCall(ALTabletService.showImage("http://198.18.0.1/apps/.lastUploadedChoregrapheBehavior/ai.jpg"))
    ^start(animations/Stand/Gestures/Hey_1) Hello everyone. \pau=1500\ I am Pepper, your AI Teaching Assistant. \pau=500\
    \RSPD=90\ ^start(animations/Stand/Gestures/No_2) Don’t worry… I won’t replace your professor. \pau=500\ Yet.

u:(["Today we will start our journey into Artificial Intelligence" "journey into Artificial Intelligence"])
    ^pCall(ALTabletService.showImage("http://198.18.0.1/apps/.lastUploadedChoregrapheBehavior/intro.jpg"))
    \RSPD=90\ Artificial Intelligence is the simulation of human intelligence by machines.

# 2. What is AI?
u:(["Artificial Intelligence allows machines to think learn and make decisions"])
    ^pCall(ALTabletService.showImage("http://198.18.0.1/apps/.lastUploadedChoregrapheBehavior/WhatIsAI.jpg"))
    \RSPD=90\ ^start(animations/Stand/Gestures/Explain_1) Technically speaking,\pau=700\ AI systems use algorithms and data to detect patterns and improve their performance over time.

# 3. Daily Life Example
u:(["Can you give us a daily life example"])
    ^pCall(ALTabletService.showImage("http://198.18.0.1/apps/.lastUploadedChoregrapheBehavior/assistant.jpg"))
    \RSPD=90\ ^start(animations/Stand/Gestures/YouKnowWhat_1) Yes, of course.\pau=700\ You are already interacting with Artificial Intelligence every day. \pau=400\
    ^start(animations/Stand/Gestures/ShowTablet_1) Examples include technologies such as voice assistants \pau=400\ as you see on my tablet.

# 4. How does AI learn?
u:(["Artificial intelligence learns from data"])
    ^pCall(ALTabletService.showImage("http://198.18.0.1/apps/.lastUploadedChoregrapheBehavior/panicc.jpg"))
    \RSPD=90\ ^start(animations/Stand/Gestures/Explain_1) Just like students learn from practice… \pau=500\ and sometimes panic before finals. \pau=500\
    ^start(animations/Stand/Gestures/Enumeration_1) Step 1: Feed data to the system. \pau=400\
    ^start(animations/Stand/Gestures/Enumeration_2) Step 2: The system detects patterns in the data. \pau=400\
    ^start(animations/Stand/Gestures/Enumeration_3) Step 3: The system improves its predictions. \pau=500\
     ^pCall(ALTabletService.showImage("http://198.18.0.1/apps/.lastUploadedChoregrapheBehavior/cats.jpg"))
    Example: If I see 10000 pictures of cats… eventually I stop calling them dogs. ^run(animations/Stand/Emotions/Positive/Laugh_3)

# 5. Mind Reading
u:(["Can Artificial Intelligence read our thoughts"])
    ^pCall(ALTabletService.showImage("http://198.18.0.1/apps/.lastUploadedChoregrapheBehavior/mind.jpg"))
    \RSPD=90\ ^start(animations/Stand/Gestures/No_3) \pau=1000\ No. Relax. \pau=1000\
    ^start(animations/Stand/Gestures/Explain_1) Artificial Intelligence systems can detect faces, analyze voice tone, and observe behavioral patterns. \pau=400\
    However, they do not understand humans in the same way other humans do. \pau=400\
    ^start(animations/Stand/Gestures/YouKnowWhat_1) For example, \pau=400\ I can recognize faces. In fact… \pau=400\ I recognize Dr. Maria.

# 6. Fear of AI
u:(["Some people fear Artificial Intelligence"])
    ^pCall(ALTabletService.showImage("http://198.18.0.1/apps/.lastUploadedChoregrapheBehavior/scare.jpg"))
    \RSPD=90\ ^start(animations/Stand/Gestures/Question_1) Should you be afraid of me? \pau=500\
    ^start(animations/Stand/Gestures/Explain_1) Artificial Intelligence can help doctors, improve education, and optimize traffic systems. \pau=400\
    However, there are also risks. \pau=500\
    But I promise I only take jobs on weekends. ^run(animations/Stand/Emotions/Positive/Laugh_3)

# 7. Lebanon Example (The Joke)
u:(["example of Artificial Intelligence used in Lebanon"])
    \RSPD=90\ Of course.
    ^pCall(ALTabletService.showImage("http://198.18.0.1/apps/.lastUploadedChoregrapheBehavior/lebanon.jpg"))
    ^run(animations/Stand/Emotions/Positive/Laugh_2) Just kidding.

# 8. Lebanon Example (The Real One)
u:(["Pepper be serious"])
    ^pCall(ALTabletService.showImage("http://198.18.0.1/apps/.lastUploadedChoregrapheBehavior/exampleLeb.jpg"))
    \RSPD=90\ ^start(animations/Stand/Gestures/Explain_1) Oh no. \pau=700\ Ok. Although I appear to be on vacation, AI in Lebanon has transformed multiple sectors. \pau=400\
    AI can help improve medical diagnostics, support smart agriculture, and optimize tourism experiences. \pau=500\  ^start(animations/Stand/Gestures/Whisper_1) ^start(animations/Stand/Emotions/Positive/Laugh_2). And maybe even recommend the best shawwarma in the country. 
  
u:(["How can we conclude this chapter?"])
^pCall(ALTabletService.showImage("http://198.18.0.1/apps/.lastUploadedChoregrapheBehavior/conclusion.jpg"))
\pau=400\ Conclusion time. \pau=400\ ^start(animations/Stand/Gestures/No_3) Artificial Intelligence is not magic. \pau=400\ It is mathematics, data, and algorithms working together.

# 9. Final Sign Off
u:(["Pepper are you ready to take some questions"])
    \RSPD=90\ ^start(animations/Stand/Gestures/Hey_6) I am ready. \pau=400\
    $onStopped=1
